 source on a bin edge              | 1 day         | 1403-05-15 00:00:00        | 1403-01-01 00:00:00 | 1403-05-15 00:00:00        | 1403-05-15 00:00:00        | t
 source on an edge before origin   | 1 day         | 1402-12-27 00:00:00        | 1403-01-01 00:00:00 | 1402-12-27 00:00:00        | 1402-12-27 00:00:00        | t
 Esfand of a common year (29 days) | 1 day         | 1403-01-01 08:00:00        | 1402-12-29 12:00:00 | 1402-12-29 12:00:00        | 1402-12-29 12:00:00        | t
 Esfand of a leap year (30 days)   | 1 day         | 1403-12-30 17:00:00        | 1403-12-29 00:00:00 | 1403-12-30 00:00:00        | 1403-12-30 00:00:00        | t
